OL,3,APetrol and diesel prices hit highest
OL,4,Asince 2022
OL,5,
OL,6,FPetrol and diesel prices have both hit
OL,7,Fthe highest levels since 2022 as the
OL,8,Fconflict in the Middle East continues
OL,9,Fto impact drivers' finances.
OL,11,FThe average price of a litre of petrol
OL,12,Fnow stands at 169.68p, according to the
OL,13,FRAC motoring body, while diesel has
OL,14,Frisen to 191.68p.
OL,16,FThe cost of filling up a vehicle is
OL,17,Fback to where it was after Russia
OL,18,Flaunched a full-scale invasion of
OL,19,FUkraine more than four years ago.
OL,23,APub: 02-MarQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
